# Captures QA locales (Playwright / debug) — jamais commisees.
artifacts/

# Scripts de verification visuelle locaux (viewport 393x852).
# Ce sont des OUTILS de travail, pas du source : ils pilotent un navigateur
# local, dependent d un serveur de dev et n ont aucun sens en production.
# Sans cette regle, un `git add -A` les embarquerait dans l historique.
verify-*.cjs
diag-*.cjs

# Working evidence for the /prepare campaign (P0.x, P1.x, ANx).
# The checklist cites these captures by filename as the proof behind each
# closed item, so they must stay on disk -- but at ~150 MB of PNG they are a
# local artifact, not history. What is committed is the proof itself: the
# dates, the measurements and the test names written in CHECKLIST-PREP.md.
proof/
am.json
amenities.json
p0*.mjs

# Harnais de mesure local (Playwright 393x852). Meme nature que les
# scripts p0*.mjs : des outils qui pilotent un navigateur de dev.
qa-local/
